{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356810-sea-and-moon-style-a-white-elephant-for-alistair","id":1356810,"title":"Sea And Moon Style : A White Elephant for Alistair","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-24T09:15:19-08:00","id":1356810,"title":"Sea And Moon Style : A White Elephant for Alistair","content":"Well, it's already Christmas in some parts of the worlds, so let's get some White Elephantry going! Here is your gift, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23684-alistair\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar23684_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"23684\" data-vbnamecard=\"23684\">Alistair</a>!<br /> <br /> So I started from this quote:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Alistair</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like Artifacts, particularly Moonsilver ones for the time being; Terrestrial or Celestial Circle Spells with social or strange focuses, as we have plenty of combat ones; <b>Martial Arts that have good synergy with Dragon-Blooded and/or Lunars</b>; Spirits, Fae, Behemoths and other Big Powerful Stuff (if it's summonable or bindable, that's even better); and character art.</div> </div> </div> </div>I then decided to focus on the bolded part. Like, <b>really </b>laser focus. Like, maybe a bit too much. And so <b>Sea And Moon Style</b> was born!<br /> <br /> Sea and Moon Style is designed as a half-DB, half-Lunar MA. The DB half has Aura mechanics and Water Aspect themes, while the Lunar half focuses on evasion and Moon themes. The style is meant to shine when used by a DB and a Lunar fighting together as a team, with each stylist leveraging their half of the tree in a way the other stylist can't. Two stylists using this MA in concert are meant to evoke the aesthetics of the <a href=\"https://66.media.tumblr.com/52a24070c8f74d957a77d9e6caf70f08/tumblr_nxo7pbL8G01s45j5io4_1280.png\" target=\"_blank\">Sea and Moon Koi</a>.<br /> <br /> <u>Disclaimer:</u> I did my best to balance the Charms, but the drawback of secret gifts is that it's hard to get good feedback for them in advance. I'll be happy to make adjustments if anything doesn't work right.<br /> <br /> Also I... may have gotten carried away a bit on the presentation. Like, just a little.<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b>Main Document : </b><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10GRRgtnXUdT2Tk7vlsrXP-si3BrB8x3A/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sea And Moon Style</a></span><br /> <br /> <br /> As a bonus, the document also includes a few extras:<br /> <br /> -The <i>Moonwater Earrings</i><b>, </b>a <b>Miscellaneous Artifact</b> that empowers Sea and Moon stylists.<br /> -<i>Universally Hospitable Moon Waters</i>, A <b>Celestial Spell</b> that can make the bottom of the sea as comfortable as your own living room.<br /> -The <i>Silver Ocean</i>, An <b>Artifact Warship</b> which can sail the seas or dive beneath the waves with equal ease.<br /> <br /> Enjoy!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1350958-the-ninth-annual-exalted-white-elephant\">White Elephant Main Thread</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-24T10:51:19-08:00","id":1356821,"title":"","content":"Thanks a bunch! I gave it a cursory reading, looks really cool and Silver Ocean comes in super handy for an upcoming game. I'll have to give the Style a better reading to figure out synergies and whatnot but I like the concept of it harmonizing with Dragon-Blooded and Lunars both. Awesome layout too!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23684-alistair","name":"Alistair","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23684_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-24T11:25:39-08:00","id":1356829,"title":"","content":"&quot;Allies within the illusion&quot; instead read as &quot;lies within the illusion&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-24T11:56:49-08:00","id":1356834,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356810-sea-and-moon-style-a-white-elephant-for-alistair?p=1356829#post1356829\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Allies within the illusion&quot; instead read as &quot;lies within the illusion&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait... If lies within the illusion gain Evasion, does that mean you become a better liar? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Thanks, fixed it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-24T13:11:03-08:00","id":1356845,"title":"","content":"I'm impressed <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Edit: Also my character needs Moon-in-water Evasion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":14713,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14713-chronos12","user":"Chronos12","date":". 12-24-2019, 05:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14713-chronos12","name":"Chronos12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14713_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-24T14:47:03-08:00","id":1356852,"title":"","content":"New version is up. Made small improvements after getting some feedback.<ul><li>Some Charms had benefits of (lower of Essence or 3), this has been increased to (lower of Essence or 5) so they can keep scaling after Essence 3.</li> <li>Reworked the Form a little to give it a bit more punch.</li> <li>Reworked Drifting Moon Retreat to be more fun in play.</li> <li>Tweaked Celestial Godfish Ascendency's out of water mobility.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Alistair</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356810-sea-and-moon-style-a-white-elephant-for-alistair?p=1356821#post1356821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks a bunch! I gave it a cursory reading, looks really cool and Silver Ocean comes in super handy for an upcoming game. I'll have to give the Style a better reading to figure out synergies and whatnot but I like the concept of it harmonizing with Dragon-Blooded and Lunars both. Awesome layout too!</div> </div> </div> </div>Glad you like it! I was worried a water-themed homebrew might be overly niche, so I'm happy to hear you just so happened to need a submarine ship!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-27T11:15:45-08:00","id":1357223,"title":"","content":"Darn this is like perfectly suitable to my current 2 player game with a Lunar Captain of an artifact warship and her Dragon Blood First Mate","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23840-teal-tara","name":"Teal Tara","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}